      "advanced": false,
      "description": "Units of the delivered amplitude in StimulationIntensity. Declared in *_nibs.json against the stimulus_intensity column, never written as a column of its own: the spec states units in the sidecar so a number in the table is never ambiguous. What the intensity was dosed against goes in IntensityReference, and the multiplier in IntensityScaling.",
