        "e-field",
        "absolute"
      ],
      "advanced": false,
      "description": "What the intensity was dosed against. 'rMT' and 'aMT' reference the measured motor thresholds; 'absolute' means the amplitude was set directly. The measured value of the reference is recorded once per session (RestingMotorThreshold / ActiveMotorThreshold).",
